{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08999","headline":"将往江淮寄李十九儋 · 韦应物","name":"将往江淮寄李十九儋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕燕东向来，文鵷亦西飞。\n如何不相见，羽翼有高卑。\n徘徊到河洛，华屋未及窥。\n秋风飘我行，远与淮海期。\n廻首隔烟雾，遥遥两相思。\n阳春自当返，短翮欲追随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}